For
people all over the world, New Year is the most important time of the year.
Many people paint their front doors red in preparation. Dragons and fireworks are also part of
celebrating the New Year period, which can last as long as two weeks, starting on the first day
of the lunar month and continuing till the moon is at its brightest.
